Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.29,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Kasagami Kurohae - Moto-Choshi)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.87,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Ashikajima - Kasagami Kurohae)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:21.90,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Titik Paling Timur Wilayah Kanto\NStasiun Ashikajima)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.54,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Tokawa - Inubou)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.03,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,(Stasiun Tokawa)
