Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa saja kegiatan sirkelnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga, kita belum\Nmenjelaskannya dengan baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tidak berwisata setiap pekan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah! Tentu saja tidak, jadi tenanglah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wisata yang jauh hanya\Ndilakukan saat libur panjang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya kita bersantai di sini\Nsambil ngobrolin kereta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atau jalan-jalan di sekitar sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kadang aku liputan ditemani mereka, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?! Kak Ushio itu T-tuber?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kalau disebut T-tuber gimana, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya kanalku harus lebih besar\Nlagi biar pede ngaku begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cita-cita Ushio bisa hidup\Ndari bikin video, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naik kereta sambil ngenalin nasi\Nkotak stasiun dan kuliner khas daerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelak aku juga mau\Ndapat sponsor dari perusahaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.35,0:00:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bakal jadi top dengan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, nanti sesekali bantu aku, ya, Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa kasih upah walau sedikit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, dermawan banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namanya juga profesional.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama, apa kamu ingin jadi sesuatu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo? Sesi pujiannya selesai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum memutuskan sampai detail, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku sadar harus segera menentukan, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, jadi agak lega.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lega?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya begitu masuk kuliah,\Nrasanya semua orang terlihat berkilauan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku khawatir, jangan-jangan cuma\Naku yang belum menentukan mau jadi apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.93,0:01:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kebanyakan orang juga begitu, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.43,0:01:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu cari kerja dan mulai berbagai hal,\Nlama-lama tahu bakal cocok di mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak dengar! Enggak dengar! Enggak dengar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah! Ushio juga alergi sama kata cari kerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang tuanya sering banget bilang,\Nboleh bikin video, tapi tetap cari kerja.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bakal tunduk sama yang berkuasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuasaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:02:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kira Kodama mau kerja\Ndi bidang perkeretaapian,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}soalnya paham banget soal kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya menyenangkan, sih...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau boleh pilih, aku lebih suka pekerjaan\Nyang mengizinkan untuk ambil cuti kapan pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu, aku bisa lebih\Ndekat dengan tujuanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuan Kodama menaklukkan semua stasiun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua stasiun...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?! Di seluruh Jepang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di seluruh dunia juga kalau bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di Tokyo saja stasiunnya banyak...\NKeren banget...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kira-kira suatu hari, aku bakal\Nmenemukan tujuanku juga tidak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio saja bisa menemukannya,\Nkamu pasti juga bisa, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya coba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Usa, halo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio ingat kalau batas\Npengumpulan tugasnya hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Profesor tadi cari kamu ke mana-mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat! Gimana, dong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa-bisa aku mengulang\Nmatkul tahun kedua nanti!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan cuma panik,\Ncepat kumpulkan sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki, kamu harus rajin kuliahnya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Usa sering jadi tempat mengadu\NUshio pas ada matkul yang gagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, adakah hal\Nyang ingin kamu lakukan, Kak Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal yang ingin kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.77,0:03:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pengin pelihara kucing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kucing? Suka kucing, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:04:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah! Dengan ini, acara penyambutan\Nmahasiswa baru Klub Tetsuryo resmi dimulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bersulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bir habis ngerjain tugas tuh\Nnikmat banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki minum apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teh melati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melati?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, langsung saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tentukan mau pergi ke mana\Ndi akhir pekan pertama kita bersama Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin bisa kita mulai\Ndari tempat yang ingin Misaki kunjungi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada enggak?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Keinginan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Maaf! Enggak ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tiba-tiba ditanya susah juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga enggak terlalu paham\Nsoal kereta, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Gimana kalau kita\Ntentukan pakai damak?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau bikin konten lagi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:04:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketahuan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:04:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak boleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini pemeran utamanya itu Misaki,\Nkontennya lain kali.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Syuting sedikit aja,\Nenggak apa-apa, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan suruh anak baru bantu kamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada hal yang kamu suka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal yang aku suka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teh yang unik dan berada di pojokan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pojokan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, misalnya kalau naik kereta, kita bisa\Nmelihat masinis kalau duduk di paling ujung.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, kalau duduk, entah kenapa\Naku lebih tenang kalau duduk di pojok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu agak unik, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paham banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Ini enggak bisa jadi referensi, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, aku tahu tempat yang cocok buat itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasain aja.\NKodama lagi mode eksplorasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stasiun paling timur di wilayah Kanto,\NStasiun Ashikajima di Jalur Kereta Listrik Choshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Choshi yang di ujung Prefektur Chiba itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stasiun akhir Kereta Listrik Choshi itu\NStasiun Tokawa yang lebih ke selatan lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekalian saja\Nkita taklukkan dua-duanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang agak jauh, tapi mereka juga\Nserius mengembangkan pariwisata,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi kupikir ada banyak daya tarik yang gampang\Ndinikmati Misaki yang masih pemula soal kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengembangan pariwisata?\NApa saja yang mereka lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Be-Berkas ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bolehkah aku lihat sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak boleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu banyak tahu, nanti rasanya seperti\Nsudah pergi ke sana dan jadi kurang terkesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bakal memandumu sebaik mungkin, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.99,0:06:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kita ketemu di Stasiun Choshi besok!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Ini Stasiun Choshi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata enggak terlalu\Ntercium bau laut, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lautnya masih agak jauh,\Nperlu naik kereta lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bangun terlalu pagi,\Njadi masih ngantuk banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baru sampai sini aja,\Nrasanya sudah kayak pergi wisata.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya. Kalian semua tinggal\Ndi dekat kampus, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tinggal di rumah orang tua,\Njadi lebih dekat sedikit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau Ushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dibangunin Kodama jam lima pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya kupikir kamu bakal\Nmalas-malasan di kasur!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka akrab banget, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, kalau begitu, ayo berangkat menuju\Ntujuan kita, Kereta Listrik Choshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada slogan yang keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ciri khas Kereta Listrik Choshi...\NNama tambahan stasiun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berbagai pihak bisa jadi sponsor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terus mereka bisa menambahkan\Nnama lagi ke nama stasiun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan ada yang pakai nama sendiri, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga mau ah, Stasiun Yagami Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bentuk bangunan stasiunnya...\NAgak unik, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, katanya dulu ada kincir angin\Ndi bagian atasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi karena sudah tua dan rusak,\Nbaling-balingnya dilepas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada kincir angin di sana...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin lihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kincir angin tepat di tengah peron\Nitu unik banget, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang yang pertama kali\Ndatang pasti kaget, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu, presiden perusahaan melihat stasiun tua ini\Ndan berpikir, "Aku mau bikin lebih keren!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu saat direnovasi, dia memasukkan\Nunsur dari berbagai negara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kincir angin di Stasiun Choshi ini\Nbergaya Belanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keretanya datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu bergaya retro jadi lucu banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kereta Listrik Choshi seri 22000.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.05,0:08:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gerbong kereta berusia hampir 50 tahun\Nyang didapatkan dari Kereta Listrik Nankai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, dari Nankai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantas rasanya kayak pernah lihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum diserahkan,\Nwarna kereta ini didominasi putih.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah ditetapkan untuk dioperasikan\Noleh Kereta Listrik Choshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:09:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}warnanya dicat ulang mengikuti warna lamanya\Nsaat beroperasi di Kereta Listrik Nankai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Datang jauh-jauh dari Osaka ke Chiba,\Nsampai sekarang masih mengangkut penumpang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya romantis, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beberapa waktu lalu, seri 2000\Nrangkaian 2001F harus dipensiunkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi senang rasanya dia bisa beroperasi di sini\Nsampai akhir, sambil dirawat dan diperbaiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seri 2000 juga punya pegangan tangan kayu\Nyang makin menonjolkan kesan retronya,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}serta jendela bergaya kaca patri...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya sudah naik, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Tunggu, dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada kursi sedekat ini dengan kabin masinis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tempat duduk VIP, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat siang, tolong tiketnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petugas stasiun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kondektur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di Kereta Listrik Choshi, kondektur\Nmemeriksa tiket seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Tiket?\NKita belum beli tiket, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini tujuannya ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami mau turun di beberapa\Nstasiun sepanjang perjalanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami mau beli tiket terusan\Ndi Stasiun Nakanocho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiket...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terusan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Empat pelanggan ini ingin beli tiket terusan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa ikut masuk ke gedung stasiun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Bagaimana ini?\NPadahal cuma mau beli tiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya, kereta cuma berhenti\Nsekitar 15 detik di stasiun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang, tenang.\NKita beli tiketnya dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya kita juga bisa membelinya\Ndari kondektur di dalam kereta,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi sekalian saja beli dari kepala stasiun\Ndi gedung stasiun, biar lebih terasa suasananya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di baliknya juga ada penjelasan\Ntentang stasiun-stasiunnya, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Togawa Tsukushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia petugas stasiun\Nyang jadi ikon Stasiun Inubou kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ikon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan temui dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, kereta selanjutnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Satu jam lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama, memang bisa mengunjungi\Nsemua tempat kalau turun di setiap stasiun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya trik rahasia untuk itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trik rahasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turun di setiap stasiun satu per satu\Nsecara berurutan bakal makan waktu lama,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.27,0:11:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalau naik kereta bergantian dua arah,\Nlalu turun zig-zag di setiap stasiun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita bisa mengunjungi semua stasiun\Ndalam waktu sekitar empat jam, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu trik rahasia yang bisa digunakan\Npembeli tiket terusan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Kodama. Aku gagal paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Po-Pokoknya, kalian bakal paham kalau dicoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya jadi deg-degan melihat ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.61,0:12:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sedang apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tukar token!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk mencegah kereta saling bertabrakan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dengan cuma mengizinkan satu kereta\Nmelintas di suatu jalur pada satu waktu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}token itu semacam surat jalan\Nyang diberikan sebagai izin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk mengoperasikan kereta\Ndi bagian jalur tersebut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ternyata pakai analog, ya.\NMenarik, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, mayoritas sudah diotomatisasi\Ndan tidak digunakan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perusahaan swasta seperti Kereta Api Tsugaru\Ndi Aomori dan Kereta Api Kumagawa di Kumamoto
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.05,0:12:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masih menggunakan sistem ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, penjelasannya nanti,\Nkita harus berangkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai! Tujuan pertama, Stasiun Ashikajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.27,0:13:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini, aku cuma memperhatikan\Nsoal pemberhentian terakhir...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih belum bisa merasakan\Nkesan pojokannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat melihat ini, jadi bikin\Nmerasa sudah sampai, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar di pojok, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mumpung di sini, ayo foto bareng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita terlalu fokus minum-minum\Nkemarin sampai lupa foto bareng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulut kita jadi kayak gurita.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi seru, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Usa buka mulut juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih gampang daripada disuruh senyum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu-Bukan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, itu aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham, kok. Aku juga cuma\Nmakan roti soalnya bangun pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama, ayo waktunya kulineran...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja, selanjutnya ke Portugal-nya Jepang,\NStasiun Inubou!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Imut! Ada banyak ubin dan gambar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ha-Halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu orang yang di gambar tiket!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar. Sedang berwisata?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya! Aku dengar ada kuliner khas\NKereta Listrik Choshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan coba taiyaki\Nkebanggaan stasiun kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Selamat makan!\N- Selamat makan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.03,0:14:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu beli berapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau mencoba rasa klasik seperti\Nkacang merah manis, cokelat, dan kustar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata, ada juga taiyaki dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagai T-tuber kuliner kereta,\Naku harus mencobanya, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang kamu masih punya uang\Nuntuk beli oleh-oleh setelah beli sebanyak itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Glundung, glundung.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.35,0:15:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misahamu, awas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia lagi bayangin apa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus jalan agak jauh ke mercusuar,\Ntapi ada banyak restoran di sana, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian bisa masuk mercusuar\Nmaksimal sampai jam 4 sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya seru, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku mau beli tiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik, sebentar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orangnya ramah sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi orang itu terlihat kerja sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada dasarnya, Kereta Listrik Choshi dikelola\Nsatu kepala stasiun yang memandu dan menjual tiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya berat, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, akhirnya sampai juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Titik akhir Jalur Kereta Listrik Choshi,\Njalur kereta paling timur di Kanto, Stasiun Tokawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ini pojokan Jalur Kereta Listrik Choshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo? Ada kereta juga di sana.\NTapi pembatasnya ada di sebelah sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo? Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}DeHa No. 801! Ada kereta yang dulu\Npernah beroperasi dipajang di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa lihat isinya juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Usa? Sejak kapan di situ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bangunan stasiunnya juga unik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya bangunan stasiunnya\Nsudah ada sejak Zaman Taisho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, populasi terus menurun\Ndi tengah usaha terus mengoperasikannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya, pernah kekurangan dana untuk pemeriksaan\Nberkala kelayakan kereta untuk beroperasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu, mereka menjual oleh-oleh\Ndan terus melakukan usaha,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sehingga sampai sekarang pun\Nkereta ini masih dicintai orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini, kupikir kereta itu sesuatu\Nyang wajar dan ada sejak dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi ternyata itu salah, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan selalu berpikir orang tua\Ndan stasiun akan selalu ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya, aku ingin kalian berkunjung\Nseperti sekarang ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi stasiun yang dicintai\Nbisa terus ada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku senang diajak kemari hari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, ayo ke pantai mumpung di sini!\NAku enggak tahan mencium baunya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.53,0:17:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kalah traktir jus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak akan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}U-Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pojokan ketiga hari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantai di musim semi boleh juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantai... Sudah lama...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama, wakame!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu! Enggak usah diangkat segala!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka berdua tidur, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya mereka berlarian terus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa Misaki senang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, jujur saja aku bingung\Nkarena tidak tahu apa-apa soal kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama memberitahuku banyak hal.\NUshio juga lucu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Usa juga baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wisata kereta api seru juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga senang bisa pergi bareng kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wisata pojokan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus mulai menentukan tujuan\Nuntuk liburan musim panas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Libur musim panas?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamp musim panas, Kodama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tur pojokan juga seru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.41,0:19:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, mungkin\Nke Tohoku atau Kyushu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Joetsu juga boleh, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.55,0:19:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau Jalur Kereta Api Matsuura?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kampung halamanmu, 'kan, Kodama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Benarkah? Aku datang\Nke acara di Shinjuku tahun lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Aku juga datang ke acara itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya! Ada posternya di ruang klub!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, temanku yang jadi pembawa acaranya\Nmengirim itu dan memintaku datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Temanmu?\NJangan-jangan, Nishiura Arisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, iya! Kok masih ingat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku diajak Nishiura ke acara itu di stasiun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, Arisa boleh juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia idolaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, tapi sayang banget pergi jauh\Nmalah ke kampung halaman...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, kok. Arisa pasti senang\Nkalau kamu pergi menemuinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, aku akan hubungi keluargaku\Ndan tanya kalian boleh menginap atau tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, dana untuk bermain bisa bertambah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya jadi tidak enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asal bawa oleh-oleh khas Tokyo\Npasti tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio, tolong tentukan pilihannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, butuh uang berapa\Nuntuk pergi ke Nagasaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mumpung ke sana, aku mau\Nliburan lewat rute yang menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada biaya penginapan,\Ntapi kalau menghitung transportasi,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}makan, dan oleh-oleh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kira-kira segini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang sakuku tidak cukup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cari saja kerja sambilan, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja sambilan! Mahasiswa banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh, tuh.\NAku jadi berdebar-debar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, ayo ke Jalur Kereta Api Matsuura!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ya!\N- Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Dia ke situ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, dia masuk sirkelku, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.93,0:22:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, wisata kali ini juga\Ndari usulan Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Libur musim panas paruh kedua\Nberarti bulan September, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:22:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.07,0:23:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.01,0:23:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, kantorku mau mengadakan\Nacara sekitar bulan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, pas banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku tidak ada ide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku akan berjuang memikirkan proyek\Nyang bakal membuat semua senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.99,0:23:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kalian harus datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.43,0:23:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.01,0:23:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki anaknya baik, tahun ini pasti seru!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.19,0:23:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip, sekalian saja kujelaskan sejarah\Nbekal stasiun dan cara membuat video...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus hati-hati\Nagar tidak terlalu berlebihan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.35,0:23:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Kerja Itu Susah."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.39,0:23:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya. Misaki nyambi enggak, ya?
